WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:02.490
3 September 2016.

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.330
The USA accepts the Paris Agreement.

3
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.710
China ratifies it on the same day.

4
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.230
On 4 November 2020, the USA's
withdrawal takes effect.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.210
On 20 January 2021, it accepts again.

6
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:21.710
In January 2025, an executive order
calls for immediate notice of withdrawal.

7
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.770
It takes effect on 27 January 2026.

8
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.710
China has not withdrawn.

9
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.270
Out twice.

10
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.050
China, never.

11
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.270
So which superpower is
doing more for the climate?

12
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.290
In this mission, you'll weigh each
superpower's share of world carbon dioxide

13
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.830
against its share of the world's people.

14
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.710
Then you'll follow a growing middle class,

15
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.030
and the oil, grain and water it demands.

16
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:50.130
Your mission: judge which superpower
is doing more for the climate.
